<title>JAPAN: Hokuetsu Paper - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Hokuetsu Paper - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 55.40		vs	   52.97</p>
<p> Operating	    5.58		vs	    5.14</p>
<p> Current		4.70		vs	    3.80</p>
<p> Net		    2.44		vs	    1.86</p>
<p> EPS		   17.05 yen	  vs	   14.66 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    144 million	  vs	 127 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.50 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p> -Special div	    -		vs	    0.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Hokuetsu Paper Mills Ltd is a manufacturer of paper and whiteboards.</p>
